        "The yakiran consumes the heart of a dead humanoid or giant within 5 feet. If the creature also less than 1 minute ago, the yakirian gains the following benefits: <br>* The yakirian absorbs the dead creature's knowledge and asks two questions. If the dead creature knew the answers in life, the yakirian learns them instantly. <br>* The yakirian's maximum and current hp increase by 10 for 1 hour. <br>* The yakirian has advantage on Strength-based attack rolls and ability checks, as well as on all saving throws for 1 hour."
